# Keeps the public/ directory in git so it is always present for:
# - the Dockerfile COPY (apps/web/Dockerfile line 60) which otherwise fails the
#   image build with "public: not found" on a fresh checkout;
# - Next.js static-asset serving (public/ is the conventional home for
#   favicons, robots.txt, and the future PWA web manifest + service worker
#   per ADR-0016).
# Remove this .gitkeep once real public assets are added.
